# The Bill of Rights: Celebrating Two Hundred Years.

**Authors:** Kaltenheuser, Skip

## Abstract
Outlines projects organized by the Pennsylvania Humanities Council to celebrate the Bill of Rights bicentennial. Concentrates on a poster exhibit consisting of 12 panels depicting civil rights with accompanying essays. Stresses promoting the Bill of Rights' relevance to students' lives and the humanities role in teaching lessons from history and political philosophy. (CH)

